            <ArticleTitle>Primary familial hypercholesterolaemia in a South African black. A case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>554-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of familial hypercholesterolaemia is presented. This is to the best of our knowledge the first report of such a case in a South African black. The modes of presentation and inheritance are discussed and the relevant literature is reviewed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
